SQLite is in the Public Domain.
===============================

The SQLite source code (sqlite3.c, sqlite3.h, sqlite3ext.h) vendored in this
directory is in the public domain.  The author disclaims copyright to this
source code.  In place of a legal notice, here is a blessing:

    May you do good and not evil.
    May you find forgiveness for yourself and forgive others.
    May you share freely, never taking more than you give.

Upstream: https://sqlite.org/
Copyright page: https://sqlite.org/copyright.html

Vendored version: 3.53.4 (amalgamation build 3530400, from
https://sqlite.org/2026/sqlite-amalgamation-3530400.zip).

All files in this directory are unmodified upstream amalgamation output.  Do
not edit them; re-pin by replacing them with a newer official amalgamation and
updating SPEC.md (G2 pin) in the same commit.

The XIOM binding code around these files (everything outside this directory)
is licensed MIT OR Apache-2.0, matching the rest of this repository.
